
= Threats to Validity

The study has a sample size of one,
and that one was — during data collection —
migrating this manuscript to Typst @madje2022
and building a bespoke presentation tool.
Time spent on tooling is known to feel like progress @munroe2013,
to expand to fill the schedule @parkinson1955,
and to take longer than any estimate @hofstadter1979.

= Conclusion

Setup optimization exhibits sharply diminishing returns;
the responsible course is to stop tinkering and write @author_inprep.

